        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Akai luanghei rim rim ngam the",
            "Houdat tang thui mak khe",
            "Nang niu neila na bam sini",
            "Akhang poison di the.",
            "",
            "Poison dithe nzianmei nun",
            "Ata npat louna",
            "Puipu guai ta ntam louna",
            "Duthang tat maan khuan the.",
            "",
            "2. He ai ning e nzianmei nun",
            "Tat kan the kaganv hei;",
            "Nruai nakum thing rim bang khou",
            "Sam tat maan ngam khuan the;",
            "",
            "3. Tat du kan the kagan gaimei,",
            "Houdat tang thui makhe;",
            "Dui kumna luang ntam khuan sini,",
            "Neikhat ariu datni."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
